1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
At two thirteen in the morning, my phone lit up.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
It was Vicheka again.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
I read it twice.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
And for the first time, I did not answer.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
The next day Vicheka smiled at everyone.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Then she looked at me like I owed her something.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
A friend sat across from me at the café.

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
He asked why I was still proving myself.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
I had no answer, only peace.
